      "release": {
        "tag_name": "v15.0.0",
        "name": "v15.0.0",
        "published_at": "2026-11-07T16:42:38Z",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/releases/tag/v15.0.0",
        "body": "# What's Changed\r\n## New Features\r\n* Let the GUI colors be choosen via hex values by @IndolikarQuantifier in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4738\r\n* Add arrow style selector by @serebryakov02 in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4769\r\n* Increment/decrement circle counter on mouse wheel by @milnadar in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4698\r\n* Add keyboard controls to monitor selector by @serebryakov02 in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4811\r\n* Fall back to native X11 capture when the portal is unavailable by @jmcarthur in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4827\r\n* Add option to disable the Circle Counter outline by @bekirsoylu in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4882\r\n* Removed the close on double click on pinned captures and moved it to shortcut which is configurable through config by @IndolikarQuantifier in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4993\r\n* add more desktop terminal emulators to TerminalLauncher by @anushTikoo in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/5010\r\n* Make the UI language picker a filterable search box by @nicitaacom in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4891\r\n\r\n* ## Bug Fixes\r\n* Fix capture when logical min/max coordinates are not zero by @rs-pro0 in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4735\r\n* Fixing the currently broken macOS packaging for x64 (Intel) by @HackintoshHD in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/pull/4795\r\n* Commit text on Esc in text tool by @serebryakov02 in https://github.com/flameshot-org/flameshot/",
